    {
      "candidateId": "mv.environment.shapeshifter-tree-environmental-adaptations.f4b04886",
      "proposedType": "environment",
      "proposedName": "Shapeshifter Tree – Environmental Adaptations",
      "summary": "Focuses on adapting to extreme environments, allowing the shapeshifter to survive and thrive in any terrain or biome. Tier 1 – Basic Adaptations 1.Amphibious Shift •Can breathe both air and water while transformed. •Gain swim speed equal to movement speed. 2.Burrowerʼs Resilience •Gain tremorsense (10 feet). •Can burrow at half movement speed through loose dirt or sand. 3.Climberʼs Grace •Gain a climb speed equal to movement speed. •Advantage on Athletics (Strength) checks for climbing. 4.Night Hunter •Gain darkvision (60 feet) while transformed. •Can see in magical darkness within 30 feet. Tier 2 – Specialized Adaptations 1.Cold Resistance •Gain resistance to cold damage. •Can survive extreme cold without penalties. 2.Heat Resistance •Gain resistance to fire damage. •Can survive extreme heat without penalties. 3.Aquatic Predator •Gain blindsight (30 feet) underwater. •Swim speed increases by +10 feet. 4.Echo Tracker •Gain echolocation (30 feet) in darkness or underwater. •Can sense invisible creatures within range. Tier 3 – Advanced Adaptations 1.Glider Wings •Can glide 10 feet horizontally for every 5 feet fallen. •Reduce fall damage by half.",
      "source": {
        "sourcePath": "part-1/Part 1/Creation/Innate Trees.PDF",
