    {
      "candidateId": "mv.environment.customization-options.96fe9260",
      "proposedType": "environment",
      "proposedName": "Customization Options",
      "summary": "Allow the GM to tailor the course based on difficulty, environment, and tone. a. Difficulty Settings •Easy: Few hazards and forgiving terrain. •Moderate: Balanced mix of hazards and opportunities for skill checks. •Hard: Frequent hazards and challenging terrain requiring advanced skills or vehicle capabilities. b. Environmental Themes •Lava Fields: Fire-resistant vehicles required; constant heat damage. •Icy Tundra: Slippery surfaces, reduced traction. •Deep Space: Zero-gravity zones and asteroid fields. •Jungle Canopy: Dense foliage, tight maneuvering spaces.",
      "source": {
        "sourcePath": "part-2/Part 2/Lore/MRC.PDF",
        "pageStart": 23,
        "pageEnd": 23,
