      "proposedType": "environment",
      "proposedName": "Putting It All Together",
      "summary": "For a Medium-length race (6 sections), the GM might roll as follows: 1.Section 1: •Terrain: Straightaway. •Hazard: None. •Boost Opportunity: Speed Pad. •Interference: None. •Checkpoint: No Checkpoint. 2.Section 2: •Terrain: Gentle Curve. •Hazard: Potholes. •Boost Opportunity: None. •Interference: Cheering Crowds. •Checkpoint: Standard Checkpoint. 3.Section 3: •Terrain: Sharp Curve. •Hazard: Debris Field. •Boost Opportunity: None. •Interference: None. •Checkpoint: No Checkpoint. 4.Section 4: •Terrain: Incline. •Hazard: Collapsing Section. •Boost Opportunity: Speed Pad.",
